    <dashboardType>MyTeamUser</dashboardType>
    <description>Dashboard components show &quot;My team&apos;s team-selling and their opportunities&quot; based on the filter in the underlying report. To see &quot;All Opportunities&quot; or &quot;My Opportunities,&quot; clone the dashboard and point components to reports with a different filter setting.</description>
